@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> FilterSelection : Select filter category or price range

state "Filter Selection" as FilterSelection
FilterSelection : entry / Select filter category or price range
FilterSelection : do / Display matching users
FilterSelection : exit / Results displayed
FilterSelection --> SearchResults : Matching users found
SearchResults : entry / Matching users displayed
SearchResults : do / User can view details of each match
SearchResults : exit / NIL
SearchResults --> [*]

@enduml
